  "visualDNA": {
    "Overview": "Proponents of the subculture have also been noted to collect shiny objects, similarly to folklore goblins, such as silverware, small jewelry, and coins. The subculture has been described as connected to maximalism and escapism. Alternative names also used for the subculture include crowcore, dirtcore, cottagegoth, feralcore, gremlincore, and mushroomcore."
